    lead:"The Reconstruction Ministry was the minority Labour government formed by Aneurin Bevan after the White Parachute Election. It governed through an informal parliamentary truce and shifting majorities, demobilized the wartime state, rebuilt essential infrastructure, renewed merchant shipping, preserved an arsenal floor, and established the British health-security settlement.",
